Phase 1: Install pfSense (Server)
1. Download pfSense ISO

Go to: https://www.pfsense.org/download/

Select: AMD64 (64-bit) → DVD Image (ISO)

Download the .iso.gz file → Extract to .iso

2. Create Virtual Machine in VirtualBox

Setting	Value
Name	pfSense
Type	BSD → FreeBSD (64-bit)
RAM	2048 MB (2GB)
Hard Disk	20 GB
Network Adapter 1	NAT (WAN)
Network Adapter 2	Internal Network → guardwall_LAN (LAN)
Network Adapter 3	Internal Network → guardwall_LAN (OPT1)
3. Boot and Install pfSense

Boot from ISO → Press Enter

Choose "Accept these Settings"

Choose "Install pfSense" → "Auto (ZFS)" → "Strip" → "Yes"

After installation, select "Reboot" → Remove ISO before rebooting
